Third-party data
----------------

data/parameters/lca_factors.csv holds aggregated GWP100 factors (IPCC 2021) extracted with openLCA from the ecoinvent 3.11
cut-off database. The ecoinvent datasets are licensed by the ecoinvent Association and are not distributed here.
Every other input value carries its source key, resolved in data/parameters/sources.csv.
